<Document>
<name>Hobart Road - Emerson Parcel, Auburn ME</name>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Deed 2026-28755</b> Keith Emerson to James &amp; Tianna Cupps<br/>City of Auburn, Androscoggin County ME &mdash; Tax Map 39 Lot 10<br/>Plan: Terradyn Consultants "Boundary Retracement Survey" 12/09/2025, job 25-178, Bk 56 Pg 62<br/><br/><b>Conveyed parcel</b> 10.031 ac (plan: 10.031)<br/><b>Remaining Emerson land</b> 11.215 ac (plan: 11.215)<br/><b>Total</b> 21.246 ac<br/><b>Deed traverse closure</b> 0.012 ft (1:238,800)<br/>Bearings: Grid North, Maine State Plane West Zone 1802, NAD83<br/><br/><i>Boundary shape and dimensions come straight from the deed and plan and are exact. Absolute position is fitted to the Hobart Road centerline, good to roughly &plusmn;10-20 ft. The wetland and gravel drive were traced from the recorded plan image, so add a few more feet of slop. Not a substitute for a staked survey.</i>]]></description>

